keys/
out/
# compiled/uncompiled probe graphs from tpu/gwcheck/probe_*.py (16-34 MB each, regenerated by the probes + the Tensor
# compiler); the logs, timings and tensor dumps beside them are evidence and stay tracked
tpu/gwcheck/dc/*.tflite
tpu/gwcheck/gw/*.tflite
# The lane's run logs ARE its evidence (rates, quality answers, verification counts are all read from them). The repo-wide
# *.log rule kept every one of them out of every results/ commit until 2026-09-23; re-included here, for results/ only.
!results/**/*.log
!tpu/gwcheck/dc/*.log
!tpu/gwcheck/gw/*.log
